---
layout: default
---
{% comment %}
Photography page: the same branded hero every other custom page uses
(_layouts/research-hub.liquid, _layouts/portfolio-index.liquid), then a
masonry grid built from whatever images sit in a gallery_path — adding a
photo is just dropping a file in that folder, no markdown page to edit.

page.groups (optional) splits the page into titled sections, each with its
own gallery_path — e.g. Engagement Photography / Family Photography. With
no groups set, page.gallery_path renders as one flat grid instead.
{% endcomment %}
<div class="call-out call-out_solid">
    <h1 class="call-out_title">{{ page.title }}</h1>
</div>

<section class="photography-page">
  {% if page.subtitle %}
  <p class="photography-page__subtitle">{{ page.subtitle }}</p>
  {% endif %}

  {% if page.intro %}
  <div class="photography-page__intro">
    {% for p in page.intro %}<p>{{ p }}</p>{% endfor %}
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  {% if page.groups %}
    {% for g in page.groups %}
    <div class="photography-page__group">
      <h2 class="photography-page__group-title">{{ g.title }}</h2>
      <div class="kppr-photo-grid">
        {% include gallery.html gallery_path=g.gallery_path %}
      </div>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  {% else %}
  <div class="kppr-photo-grid">
    {% include gallery.html gallery_path=page.gallery_path %}
  </div>
  {% endif %}
</section>
